awakening and liberation.

10
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:52,880
People placed unreserved trust in complete
strangers with natural, naive openness.

11
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:57,434
The media continually romanticized
this free-spirited ethos,

12
00:00:57,434 --> 00:01:01,660
inadvertently creating a collective
blind spot of naivety across society.

13
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:05,861
It was precisely this collapse of
vigilance that created an immense

14
00:01:05,861 --> 00:01:09,140
